## Discussion structure (when documenting)

- Start a new conversation doc per distinct topic or phase.
- Seed with: Context & Goal, Non-goals, Acceptance criteria, Links to specific files, and a note to cite which files influenced conclusions.

## Context reuse

- Reference earlier discussions by title and path.
- Link to relevant philosophies and system prompts to keep principles in play.

## Evolution and continuity

- Open a new conversation when scope shifts; link forward/back between threads.
- Periodically refine personas and working docs as the project evolves; summarize changes in the relevant `README.md`.
